.SH NAME
omorfos\-panel \- The panel of the omorfos desktop: workspaces and windows along the edge of a screen
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\fBomorfos\-panel\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
The omorfos compositor starts it, and again if it ends.
